title: Opposition budget process

@start
title: Open the government's budget file
new-page: true
view-if: annual_budget_left_cabinet_authority = 0
call: poland_normalize
on-arrival: {!
Q.annual_budget_year = Number(Q.annual_budget_year) || Number(Q.year) || 2019;
Q.annual_budget_fiscal_year = Q.annual_budget_year + 1;
Q.opposition_budget_stage = 1;
Q.opposition_budget_priority_count = 0;
Q.opposition_budget_priority_1_code = 0;
Q.opposition_budget_priority_2_code = 0;
Q.opposition_budget_priority_1 = "Not selected";
Q.opposition_budget_priority_2 = "Not selected";
Q.opposition_budget_priority_candidate_code = 0;
Q.opposition_budget_priority_candidate = "Not selected";
Q.opposition_budget_conference_management = "Conference not held";
Q.opposition_budget_conference_code = 0;
Q.opposition_budget_rebel_count = 0;
Q.opposition_budget_named_rebels = "None";
Q.opposition_budget_tactic = "No tactic selected";
Q.opposition_budget_tactic_code = 0;
Q.opposition_budget_amendment_1 = "No amendment filed";
Q.opposition_budget_amendment_2 = "No amendment filed";
Q.opposition_budget_amendment_1_passed = 0;
Q.opposition_budget_amendment_2_passed = 0;
Q.opposition_budget_amendments_passed = 0;
Q.opposition_budget_negotiation_score = 0;
Q.opposition_budget_negotiation_threshold = 0;
Q.annual_budget_passed = 0;
Q.annual_budget_margin = 0;
Q.annual_budget_shortfall = 0;
Q.annual_budget_left_yes = 0;
Q.annual_budget_left_no = 0;
Q.annual_budget_left_abstain = 0;
Q.annual_budget_government_yes = 0;
Q.annual_budget_government_abstain = 0;
Q.annual_budget_yes = 0;
Q.annual_budget_no = 0;
Q.annual_budget_abstain = 0;

const oppositionYear = Number(Q.annual_budget_year) || 2019;
const oppositionDrafts = {
    2019: {
        title: "PiS's 2020 consolidation budget",
        priorities: "social transfers, revenue centralisation and continuity after the election",
        omissions: "public-sector pay, housing, labour inspection and durable local finance"
    },
    2020: {
        title: "PiS's 2021 pandemic budget",
        priorities: "emergency health spending, anti-crisis shields and central control of recovery",
        omissions: "full sick-pay replacement, council liquidity, housing security and reproductive care"
    },
    2021: {
        title: "PiS's 2022 Polish Deal budget",
        priorities: "the Polish Deal tax settlement, health contributions and discretionary local compensation",
        omissions: "administrative repair, rights safeguards, stable hospital finance and transparent local grants"
    },
    2022: {
        title: "PiS's 2023 war-and-inflation budget",
        priorities: "defence, energy shields, refugee support and inflation relief",
        omissions: "a wage floor, long-term refugee services, housing and accountable procurement"
    },
    2023: {
        title: "the inherited 2024 transition budget",
        priorities: "teacher pay, IVF restoration, local-government finance and a rapid public-media transition",
        omissions: "a settled housing programme, durable health staffing and the full equality timetable"
    },
    2024: {
        title: "the coalition's first full 2025 budget",
        priorities: "flood reconstruction, record defence commitments, KPO co-financing and coalition continuity",
        omissions: "Razem's wage, housing and health promises and a funded route after the abortion defeat"
    },
    2025: {
        title: "the 2026 post-presidential budget",
        priorities: "defence, school reform, coalition survival and accommodation with a hostile Palace",
        omissions: "shorter working time, enforceable collective bargaining, housing delivery and local-service staffing"
    },
    2026: {
        title: "the pre-election 2027 budget",
        priorities: "deficit restraint, defence, remaining KPO milestones and pre-election protection of incumbents",
        omissions: "funded Labour Inspection powers, partnership delivery, municipal services and social housing"
    }
};
const oppositionDraft = oppositionDrafts[oppositionYear] || oppositionDrafts[2026];
Q.opposition_budget_draft_title = oppositionDraft.title;
Q.opposition_budget_draft_priorities = oppositionDraft.priorities;
Q.opposition_budget_draft_omissions = oppositionDraft.omissions;

const chamberTotal = Math.max(1, Math.round(Number(Q.sejm_total) || 460));
const leftSeats = Math.max(
    0,
    Math.min(chamberTotal, Math.round(Number(Q.left_seats) || 0))
);
let governmentSeats = Math.round(Number(Q.coalition_seats) || 0);
const storedGovernmentPreview =
    Math.round(Number(Q.annual_budget_preview_government_yes) || 0) +
    Math.round(Number(Q.annual_budget_preview_government_abstain) || 0);
if (oppositionYear >= 2023 && storedGovernmentPreview > 0) {
    governmentSeats = storedGovernmentPreview;
}
if (governmentSeats <= 0) {
    if (Q.government_party == "pis") {
        governmentSeats = Math.round(Number(Q.pis_seats) || 0);
    } else if (Q.government_party == "ko") {
        governmentSeats =
            Math.round(Number(Q.ko_seats) || 0) +
            Math.round(Number(Q.p2050_seats) || 0) +
            Math.round(Number(Q.psl_seats) || 0);
    } else if (Q.government_party == "psl") {
        governmentSeats = Math.round(Number(Q.psl_seats) || 0);
    } else if (Q.government_party == "p2050") {
        governmentSeats = Math.round(Number(Q.p2050_seats) || 0);
    }
}
governmentSeats = Math.max(
    0,
    Math.min(chamberTotal - leftSeats, governmentSeats)
);
Q.opposition_budget_government_seats = governmentSeats;
Q.opposition_budget_left_seats = leftSeats;
Q.opposition_budget_other_opposition_seats = Math.max(
    0,
    chamberTotal - governmentSeats - leftSeats
);
Q.opposition_budget_government_margin = governmentSeats -
    Q.opposition_budget_other_opposition_seats;
Q.opposition_budget_left_is_pivotal =
    governmentSeats <= Q.opposition_budget_other_opposition_seats ? 1 : 0;
Q.opposition_budget_legal_influence = oppositionYear <= 2020
    ? "Sejm amendments, a recorded vote and Senate amendments; no executive spending authority"
    : "Sejm amendments, bargaining and a recorded vote; no executive spending authority";
!}
go-to: audit if opposition_budget_audit_pending = 1 and opposition_budget_audit_year < annual_budget_year; read_draft if opposition_budget_audit_pending = 0 or opposition_budget_audit_year >= annual_budget_year

@audit
title: Prior-year audit — What actually reached public services
new-page: true
view-if: opposition_budget_audit_pending = 1 and opposition_budget_audit_year < annual_budget_year
call: poland_normalize
on-arrival: {!
Q.opposition_budget_stage = 6;
Q.opposition_budget_audit_capacity_gain = 0;
const applyEnactedPriority = function(code) {
    const priorityCode = Number(code) || 0;
    if (priorityCode == 1) {
        Q.household_security += 2;
    } else if (priorityCode == 2 || priorityCode == 7) {
        Q.health_capacity += 2;
    } else if (priorityCode == 3) {
        Q.household_security += 1;
        Q.local_network += 1;
    } else if (priorityCode == 4 || priorityCode == 15) {
        Q.minority_safety += 2;
    } else if (priorityCode == 5 || priorityCode == 11 || priorityCode == 14) {
        Q.local_network += 2;
    } else if (priorityCode == 6) {
        Q.military_trust += 2;
    } else if (priorityCode == 8) {
        Q.government_delivery += 1;
        Q.climate_state_capacity += 1;
    } else if (priorityCode == 9) {
        Q.government_procedural_restraint += 2;
    } else if (priorityCode == 10) {
        Q.refugee_service_capacity += 1;
        Q.energy_security += 1;
    } else if (priorityCode == 12) {
        Q.local_network += 1;
        Q.household_security += 1;
    } else if (priorityCode == 13 || priorityCode == 16) {
        Q.household_security += 1;
        Q.government_delivery += 1;
    }
    if (priorityCode > 0) Q.opposition_budget_audit_capacity_gain += 2;
};
if (Q.opposition_budget_audit_enacted) {
    if (Q.opposition_budget_audit_priority_1_enacted) {
        applyEnactedPriority(Q.opposition_budget_audit_priority_1_code);
    }
    if (Q.opposition_budget_audit_priority_2_enacted) {
        applyEnactedPriority(Q.opposition_budget_audit_priority_2_code);
    }
    Q.government_delivery += Math.max(
        1,
        Number(Q.opposition_budget_audit_priority_1_enacted) +
            Number(Q.opposition_budget_audit_priority_2_enacted)
    );
    Q.opposition_budget_audit_result =
        "Enacted clauses added " + Q.opposition_budget_audit_capacity_gain +
        " public-capacity points";
} else if (Q.opposition_budget_audit_tactic_code == 1) {
    Q.opposition_budget_audit_result =
        "The shadow programme changed political ownership, not public capacity";
} else {
    Q.opposition_budget_audit_result =
        "No enacted Lewica clause changed public capacity";
}
Q.opposition_budget_audit_done = 1;
Q.opposition_budget_audit_pending = 0;
Q.news_headline = Q.opposition_budget_audit_result;
!}

= Fiscal-year [+ opposition_budget_audit_fiscal_year +] accounts

Last year's tactic was **[+ opposition_budget_audit_tactic +]**. The recorded
Lewica clauses were **[+ opposition_budget_audit_amendment_1 +]** and **[+
opposition_budget_audit_amendment_2 +]**.

<div class="ledger-section ledger-section-first"><div class="ledger-title">Delivery audit</div>
<div class="ledger-row"><span>Budget enacted</span><b>[? if opposition_budget_audit_budget_passed: yes?][? if not opposition_budget_audit_budget_passed: no?]</b></div>
<div class="ledger-row"><span>Lewica clause enacted</span><b>[? if opposition_budget_audit_enacted: yes?][? if not opposition_budget_audit_enacted: no?]</b></div>
<div class="ledger-row"><span>Public-capacity gain</span><b>[+ opposition_budget_audit_capacity_gain +]</b></div>
<div class="ledger-row"><span>Finding</span><b>[+ opposition_budget_audit_result +]</b></div></div>

A passed Senate proposal, a press release or a cabinet promise is not counted
as delivery. Only language that survived the final bill changes hospitals,
household security, councils, defence or administrative capacity.

- @audit_continue: Open this year's draft

@audit_continue
go-to: poland_budget_2023_2026.annual_budget if annual_budget_left_cabinet_authority = 1; read_draft if annual_budget_left_cabinet_authority = 0

@read_draft
title: Step 1 of 4 — Read the government draft
new-page: true
on-arrival: opposition_budget_stage = 1

= [+ opposition_budget_draft_title +]

The government's actual priorities are **[+ opposition_budget_draft_priorities
+]**. Its draft leaves **[+ opposition_budget_draft_omissions +]** exposed.

<div class="ledger-section ledger-section-first"><div class="ledger-title">What the chamber can do</div>
<div class="ledger-row"><span>Government bloc</span><b>[+ opposition_budget_government_seats +] seats</b></div>
<div class="ledger-row"><span>Other opposition</span><b>[+ opposition_budget_other_opposition_seats +] seats</b></div>
<div class="ledger-row"><span>Lewica controls</span><b>[+ opposition_budget_left_seats +] votes</b></div>
<div class="ledger-row"><span>Lewica pivotal on the current count</span><b>[? if opposition_budget_left_is_pivotal: yes?][? if not opposition_budget_left_is_pivotal: no?]</b></div>
<div class="ledger-row"><span>Legal influence</span><b>[+ opposition_budget_legal_influence +]</b></div></div>

Lewica may amend, bargain, abstain or oppose. It cannot spend a złoty, order a
ministry to implement a promise or treat a shadow programme as enacted law.

- @priorities: Choose two Left priorities

@priorities
title: Step 2 of 4 — Choose two Left priorities
new-page: true

The menu changes with the year's crises. Choose exactly two. The conference
will have to reconcile both; the parliamentary tactic will determine whether
either becomes an amendment, a concession or only a shadow-programme claim.

Selected: **[+ opposition_budget_priority_1 +]**[? if opposition_budget_priority_count = 2: and **[+ opposition_budget_priority_2 +]**?].

- @priority_wages
- @priority_services
- @priority_housing
- @priority_equality
- @priority_local
- @priority_security
